  "new_claims": [
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "唐僧走入一片紫色丛林，林中到处长着奇怪植物、飘着终年不散的青色雾气，越往里越潮湿昏暗，枝叶完全遮蔽天空，唐僧完全迷路。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "唐僧也完全迷路了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "有声音回答\"谢谢\"，唐僧回头看见一棵会说话的树，紫黑色树干上有两只一眨一眨的眼睛。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "看见一棵会说话的树"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "唐僧认为这地方生机旺盛、生命奇妙，伸手去摸那棵树，树干上泌满紫色汁液，触感湿滑。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "那树干上泌满紫色的汁液"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "怪树自述：上万年来没有人来到它面前；几千年前有一群猴子在它身上戏耍，后来都不知去向，那时它还没有眼睛，只能感觉到身边有许多会动的生灵在说话唱歌。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0005/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0005"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "有上万年没有人来到我面前了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "怪树自称花了十万年才长出眼睛，并说它还没有手、没有腿，以后都会长出来。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0005/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0005"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我花了十万年才长出眼睛"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "唐僧回答那群猴子\"他们死了\"，并向怪树解释死就是什么也看不见、听不见、感觉不到、不会想，如同未出生时一样。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "他们死了。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "怪树表示不要死也不要孤独地生活，说它现在就想摸一摸身边的同类、摸一摸唐僧，并称唐僧身上的气味令它心醉。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0005/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0005"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你身上的气味真令我心醉"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-8",
      "text": "唐僧问怪树没有嘴用什么说话，怪树抖了抖身前一根枝条，枝条上有一张人的嘴。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "那上面有一张人的嘴"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-9",
      "text": "怪树称那张嘴不是自己的、是它捡来的：三百年前有一个人在这里被吃了，剩下这张嘴，它用自己的树汁浸泡使其不腐烂，又花几十年长出枝条把它捡起。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0005/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0005"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "是我捡的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-10",
      "text": "唐僧批评怪树投机取巧，说\"不是你的，就要把它还给来处\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "不是你的，就要把它还给来处"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-11",
      "text": "怪树反问唐僧是否想知道那个人为什么被吃，唐僧问是否因为看见了它的缘故，怪树答\"是\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0005/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0005"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "是因为看见了你的缘故吗"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-12",
      "text": "唐僧发现自己的脚不知何时已被藤蔓缠住，他背后响起低沉的呜嗷声，一股腥气喷到脖子上，他无法回头。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "已被藤蔓缠住了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-13",
      "text": "怪树对背后的存在说\"把他的手留给我，我喜欢那双手\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0005/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0005"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "把他的手留给我"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-14",
      "text": "唐僧讥讽怪树\"别人吃剩的你也要，做妖做到你这份儿上，是我就一头撞死算了\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "做妖做到你这份儿上"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-15",
      "text": "怪树回应唐僧说\"如果有头的话，我会考虑的\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0005/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0005"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我会考虑的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-16",
      "text": "有双爪子搭上了唐僧的肩头。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "有双爪子搭上了唐僧的肩头"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-17",
      "text": "怪树要求等一下，说想最后再和唐僧说一句话，因为有了这张嘴之后唐僧是第一个能和它说话的，它对一个人被吃时的心理活动很感兴趣。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0005/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0005"
      },
      "revealed_at": 2,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000002.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000002",
          "chapter_order": 2,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "这是第一个能和我说话的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-18",
      "text": "唐僧说\"早死早超生，我才不怕\"，随后深吸一口气，突然大叫\"救命啊\"。",
